# Vigil agent-build configuration.
#
# worktree-up.sh sources this file (or the fixture named by $VIGIL_BUILD_ENV,
# used only by tests/) instead of hardcoding repository identity. The one
# code path that needs VIGIL_BUILD_REPO fails immediately with "not
# configured: set VIGIL_BUILD_REPO in build.env" when it is still marked
# TODO(bootstrap), rather than guessing. --slice and resuming an existing
# branch need no repository configured at all.
#
# Populate the TODO(bootstrap) value once the repository exists; do not
# invent it.

# "owner/name" of the GitHub repository worktree-up.sh links issues against.
VIGIL_BUILD_REPO=ceponatia/vigil
